msgstr ""

#: ospy/options.py:230
msgid "Experimental and disabled by default. When enabled, a settings save is committed only if both the shelve/DBM database and its SQLite shadow are written and verified successfully. On SQLite failure the temporary save is discarded and the previous active settings remain unchanged."
msgstr ""

